.TH DWM-UI 1 dwm\-VERSION
.SH NAME
dwm-ui \- keybinding and UI reference for dwm-fractal
.SH DESCRIPTION
This man page documents all keybindings, mouse bindings, layouts, and
configuration of the dwm-fractal build. Mod is the Super (Windows) key
(Mod4Mask). The status bar is at the bottom.
.SH LAYOUTS
.TP
.B Mod\-t
Tile layout (master left, slaves right).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-t
Bstack layout (master top, slaves bottom).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-u
Monocle layout (all windows stacked).
.TP
.B Mod\-i
Centered master (master middle, slaves sides).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-i
Quad layout (centered master with floating master).
.TP
.B Mod\-e
Floating layout (no tiling).
.SH WINDOW MANAGEMENT
.TP
.B Mod\-j, Mod\-k
Focus next/previous window.
.TP
.B Mod\-v
Focus master window.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-j, Mod\-Shift\-k
Push focused window down/up in stack.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-v
Push focused window to master.
.TP
.B Mod\-h
Decrease master area size by 5%.
.TP
.B Mod\-l
Increase master area size by 5%.
.TP
.B Mod\-q
Kill focused client.
.TP
.B Mod\-Space
Zoom \(em swap focused window with master.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-Space
Toggle floating/tiled state.
.TP
.B Mod\-f
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
.B Mod\-s
Toggle sticky.
.TP
.B Mod\-Left, Mod\-Right
Focus previous/next client.
.TP
.B Mod\-Return
Spawn terminal (st).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-Return
Toggle scratchpad terminal (120x34).
.SH TAG MANAGEMENT
Tags: term, browse1, browse2, monitor, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9.
.TP
.B Mod\-[1..9]
View tag.
.TP
.B Mod\-Ctrl\-[1..9]
Toggle tag visibility.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-[1..9]
Move client to tag.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-Ctrl\-[1..9]
Toggle tag on client.
.TP
.B Mod\-g, Mod\-Page_Up
Cycle to previous tag.
.TP
.B Mod\-Page_Down
Cycle to next tag.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-g, Mod\-Shift\-Page_Up
Move client to previous tag.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-Page_Down
Move client to next tag.
.TP
.B Mod\-Backslash
View all tags.
.SH GAPS
.TP
.B Mod\-a
Toggle gaps on/off.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-a
Reset gaps to defaults.
.TP
.B Mod\-z
Increase gaps by 3.
.TP
.B Mod\-x
Decrease gaps by 3.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-apostrophe
Toggle smart gaps.
.SH APPLICATION LAUNCHERS
.TP
.B Mod\-d
App launcher (dmenu from apps list).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-d
Launch KeePassXC.
.TP
.B Mod\-w
Launch qutebrowser.
.TP
.B Mod\-t
Launch Tor Browser.
.TP
.B Mod\-v
Launch editor (vim in terminal).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-w
Web search via dmenu.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-o
RSS reader via dmenu, open selection in browser.
.TP
.B Mod\-o
Timer with dmenu.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-e
Launch abook (address book).
.TP
.B Mod\-r
Launch termshark (sudo).
.TP
.B Mod\-BackSpace, Mod\-Shift\-BackSpace
System action menu (sysact).
.TP
.B Mod\-b
Kill a process by name (dmenu).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-b
Set random wallpaper (feh).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-z
Launch goom visualizer.
.TP
.B Mod\-n
Launch drawop.
.TP
.B Mod\-m
Launch sv.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-m
Music player (mpv) from ~/Personal/Mus.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-v
Launch FCEUX NES emulator.
.SH MEDIA CONTROLS
.TP
.B Mod\-minus, Mod\-Shift\-minus
Volume up by 5% and 15%.
.TP
.B Mod\-plus, Mod\-Shift\-plus
Volume down by 5% and 15%.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-p
Pause all media (pauseallmpv).
.SH MULTIMEDIA KEYS (no modifier)
.TP
.B AudioMute
Toggle mute.
.TP
.B AudioRaiseVolume
Volume +5%.
.TP
.B AudioLowerVolume
Volume \-5%.
.TP
.B AudioMicMute
Toggle microphone mute.
.SH HELP
.TP
.B Mod\-F1
Open this guide in terminal (man dwm-ui).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-h
Open this guide in terminal (man dwm-ui).
.SH MISCELLANEOUS
.TP
.B Mod\-u
Emoji picker (dmenu to xclip).
.TP
.B Mod\-Insert
Snippet picker (dmenu to xdotool).
.TP
.B Mod\-F3
Screenshot region (scrot \-s).
.TP
.B Mod\-F4
Open alsamixer in terminal.
.TP
.B Mod\-F5
Screen lock (alt config).
.TP
.B Mod\-F6
Screen lock (default).
.TP
.B Mod\-F11
Webcam viewer via mpv.
.TP
.B Mod\-Print
Recording menu (dmenurecord).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-Print, Mod\-Delete
Kill recording (dmenurecord kill).
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-q
Quit dwm.
.TP
.B Mod\-Shift\-r
Restart dwm.
.SH MOUSE BINDINGS
.TP
.B Mod\-Button1 on client
Move window (floats it).
.TP
.B Mod\-Button3 on client
Resize window (floats it).
.TP
.B Mod\-Button2 on client
Reset gaps to default.
.TP
.B Mod\-Button4 on client
Increase gaps by 1.
.TP
.B Mod\-Button5 on client
Decrease gaps by 1.
.TP
.B Button2 on win title
Zoom (swap with master).
.TP
.B Button1..5 on status text
Signal dwmblocks blocks 1..5.
.TP
.B Shift\-Button1 on status text
Signal dwmblocks block 6.
.TP
.B Shift\-Button3 on status text
Edit dwmblocks config.h in vim.
.TP
.B Button1 on tag
View tag.
.TP
.B Button3 on tag
Toggle tag view.
.TP
.B Mod\-Button1 on tag
Tag client.
.TP
.B Mod\-Button3 on tag
Toggle tag on client.
.TP
.B Button4/5 on tag
Cycle tags.
.TP
.B Button2 on root
Toggle bar visibility.
.SH APPEARANCE
.TP
.B Font
IosevkaTerm Nerd Font 13pt.
.TP
.B Border
2px.
.TP
.B Window corners
24px (picom compositor).
.TP
.B Bar
Bottom.
.TP
.B Snap
32px.
.TP
.B Default mfact
0.55.
.TP
.B Colors
Tokyo Night inspired palette (see config.h for hex values). Schemes: Norm, Sel, Mem, Ok, Err, Date, HDD.
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGHUP (1)
Restart dwm.
.TP
.B SIGTERM (15)
Terminate dwm.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
The following external programs are required for full functionality:
.TP 8
.B Core
st (terminal), dmenu (launcher), dwmblocks (status bar),
picom (compositor), IosevkaTerm Nerd Font.
.TP
.B System
pactl (volume), mpv (player), feh (wallpaper),
scrot (screenshot), vim (editor), alsamixer.
.TP
.B Apps
qutebrowser, Tor Browser, keepassxc, mupdf, fceux, abook,
termshark, xclip, xdotool.
.TP
.B Custom scripts (\(ti/.local/bin/)
m-apps (app launcher), timer_term, ws (url opener),
hnrss_reader (RSS), img_select (wallpaper picker),
goom (visualizer), drawop, sv (video browser),
screenlock (lock screen), dmenurecord (recording),
pauseallmpv, sysact (system menu).
.TP
.B dwmblocks depends
free, df, date, awk, tail, rev, cut, ip, ping.
.SH FILES
.I config.h
\(em compile-time configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dwm (1),
.BR dmenu (1),
.BR st (1),
.BR dwmblocks (1)
